                        </signed>
                        <date>1939-1940</date> </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="global-note1" type="global">The illustration on this Christmas card shows a view looking east on Rue Norvins in Paris toward Paroisse Saint-Pierre de Montmartre and behind it the dome of Sacré-Coeur Basilica.</note>
